<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Are you walking daily by the Savior’s side?</l><l>Are you washed in the blood of the Lamb?</l><l>Do you rest each moment in the Crucified?</l><l>Are you washed in the blood of the Lamb?</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When the Bridegroom cometh will your robes be white!</l><l>Are you washed in the blood of the Lamb?</l><l>Will your soul be ready for His presence bright,</l><l>And be washed in the blood of the Lamb?</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lay aside the garments that are stained with sin,</l><l>And be washed in the blood of the Lamb;</l><l>There’s a fountain flowing for the soul unclean,</l><l>O be washed in the blood of the Lamb.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
